"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T14:28:53-07:00","id":1459582,"title":"","content":"Awesome \ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude0a. I\u2019m looking forward to Anima.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-11T14:50:01-07:00","id":1459696,"title":"","content":"To be clear, Eddy said (at about 5:20 into the episode): &quot;It happens after the one we've already announced, which is Werewolf Apocalyptic Records. So it will happen at some point after that.&quot;<br /> <br /> That doesn't mean it'll be the Kickstarter directly following Apocalyptic Records. It just means that we're going to be doing an Anima Kickstarter, our next KS is Apocalyptic Records, so the Anima Kickstarter will follow AR at some point. It might be immediately after AR. It might be sometime next year. It might be after Exigents.<br /> <br /> Please be patient.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-20T14:08:41-07:00","id":1460577,"title":"","content":"Too bad, it was completely hypad!!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/vt9e1au9u2058x0/Screenshot_1.png?raw=1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-08T19:54:15-08:00","id":1467228,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Trinity <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/anima?__eep__=6&amp;__gid__=260018727370&amp;__cft__&#91;0]=AZW9miXFDMDAmm2-vfMjS0BBt_VgLYVSnHkX83aluvGR8Tts-ZEw_4Xb2vKD6ueuQSQ9zNrNiIg-aqtSkhw92-9kdcuq7H83GrdHRUHIfz5t4kGKLiWVjs7niWvBh9qwG786jjzYmcP0Q4ACLAZTwzJEeiyhpfJKY4zvSiReyKruvFwWtAtHLROLCCLZnHjy0ko&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" target=\"_blank\">#Anima</a></span> Kickstarter is starting on November 18th! Here's how the creators sum up what it is! (Sounds like more digestible postpunk, to me <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">What is Trinity Continuum: Anima?</span></span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">* <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b>A brand-new Trinity Continuum game.</b> </span>Unlike TC: \u00c6on, TC: Aberrant, and TC: Adventure!, this isn\u2019t the second edition of a previously made game. This is a completely new setting in the year 2084, sitting between TC: \u00c6on and TC: Aberrant.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">* <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b>A new take on cyberpunk.</b> </span>Unlike a hundred gritty, worn-down cyberpunk dystopias, the city of Cascade is shiny and new. Characters will still fight a fascist government and unethical corporations, but they do so in a gleaming city full of potential and hope.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">* <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b>A video game in an RPG.</b> </span>This isn\u2019t just a tabletop adaptation of a popular video game; this is a new system that allows the characters of TC: Anima to themselves play in a fully immersive MMO. The rules are designed to make the experience feel like playing in a video game.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">* <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b>A modern take on cyberware.</b> </span>No loss of \u201chumanity\u201d or \u201cessence\u201d happens in TC: Anima. Nearly every character has cyberware, either as a brain implant or as assistive devices after a devastating war. Using cyberware doesn\u2019t make you less of a person, but it does open new dramatic possibilities.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">* <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b>A mystery you can dig into right away.</b> </span>Streamers of the popular video game Terra Surge are disappearing. Why? That question is something that can draw the player characters in immediately, or Storyguides can focus on other parts of the setting to create their own conflicts and intrigues.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=10217199718059915&amp;set=gm.10158759086547371&amp;__cft__&#91;0]=AZW9miXFDMDAmm2-vfMjS0BBt_VgLYVSnHkX83aluvGR8Tts-ZEw_4Xb2vKD6ueuQSQ9zNrNiIg-aqtSkhw92-9kdcuq7H83GrdHRUHIfz5t4kGKLiWVjs7niWvBh9qwG786jjzYmcP0Q4ACLAZTwzJEeiyhpfJKY4zvSiReyKruvFwWtAtHLROLCCLZnHjy0ko&amp;__tn__=EH-R\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://scontent-waw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t1.6435-9/254957377_10217199718099916_6616286055519887971_n.jpg?_nc_cat=109&amp;ccb=1-5&amp;_nc_sid=825194&amp;_nc_ohc=1YOBf0cEANkAX8Ldags&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-waw1-1.xx&amp;oh=6727fe05d1e00e37aa36f2d714e40fa4&amp;oe=61B10530\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-10-2021, 03:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-20T23:12:26-08:00","id":1468460,"title":"","content":"So now I read proper Kickstarter preview of the game, I have some questions...<br /> <br /> <b>Is OpNet really 'new Internet EVERYWHERE'?</b><br /> <br /> I understand it's wireless - and with GLASS or neural helmet you can <u>literally</u> sense it - very much like Metaverse planned by real Microsoft and (former) Facebook. ( Links about metaverse plans <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2021/11/2/22758974/microsoft-teams-metaverse-mesh-3d-avatars-meetings-features\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a href=\"https://thedebrief.org/facebook-metaverse/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> ) But the limitations of nowadays ubernetwork is you need devices for it - without cables and transit stations, you cannot have network. Just like my parents live on the suburbs and there is simply lack of infrastructure to have stable. fast network.<br /> <br /> <b>How it is with OpNet? Can I operate literally everywhere and always?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-21-2021, 02:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-21T02:19:15-08:00","id":1468472,"title":"","content":"AFAIK, yes. I mean, there is some delay but you even have it on the moon. This is not the real world. This is a world that had people with intelligence that designed things that could defied and redefined physics. They made the OpNet accessible everywhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-21T06:04:02-08:00","id":1468486,"title":"","content":"OpNet is not everywhere or entirely wireless, it was a big revolution in the way internet works during Nova Era, much like hyperfusion. How it works and what is the difference? Have no idea, but it works as internet but faster and with less issues in general. You don\u2019t need a computer on you to use it, you can use it like you use internet today, but using glass or the proper gear, you can access the expanded reality, with advertisements, information and everything else, while walking around the city. You can also jump into full virtual reality, and that\u2019s where TerraSurge exists.<br /> <br /> Most places have a system that manage to distribute opnet signal all around, like a cross between WiFi and Cellphone signals, and entirely free. It covers almost everywhere, but you may have issues in places like caves and the middle of the jungle in Earth.<br /> <br /> The Moon have a lesser coverage, but all the places that matter (where people live) are covered. If you go for a moon walk, and walk long enough you may find yourself without signal. The opnet system in the moon is independent of Earth (and each planet will have it too eventually), but they communicate, so you can get data from all around the universe, yet it is limited by light speed, so there is a big lag in the moon when accessing earth (about 1 sec) (that\u2019s why they put a server of TerraSurge in Luna).<br /> <br /> Aeon, page 31, describe how it works in 2120s but it must be not much different from 2080s.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-21T13:36:41-08:00","id":1468523,"title":"","content":"<b>But OpNet <i><u>is</u></i> the full scences immersion?</b> Like in <b>Caprica</b> series virtual reality - or <b>Matrix</b> simulation? When using GLASS or neural helmet you FEEL you are inside the place you are in network? So it is the <a href=\"https://coinmarketcap.com/alexandria/article/what-is-the-metaverse-an-overview-and-a-deep-dive-of-the-top-metaverses\" target=\"_blank\">practical on what idea of metaverse is</a>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-21T13:46:59-08:00","id":1468525,"title":"","content":"No, Opnet is just the internet. There are several \u201cprotocols\u201d people navigate in the OpNet, one is regular file sharing, one is expanded reality and another is full virtual reality.<br /> <br /> As far as I am aware, there is no reference for a Caprica like virtual reality connecting the various games, in other words, you don\u2019t break a firewall in virtual reality to access the companies secret files. Virtual realities are the several games, vids and simulations available in the OpNet, but the OpNet is not a virtual reality.<br /> <br /> Similarly you don\u2019t have access to a robot programming using expanded reality, at least not as a standard. You need to access it system, not the expanded reality related to the robot. Sure, you may have equipments interacting to you using expanded reality, but it is not a \u201csystem access\u201d, it is a optional interaction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T13:21:22-08:00","id":1468629,"title":"","content":"Man... the thought there would need to still be LGBTQ specific teen shelters in the 2080s is deeply depressing (since the reason such shelters need to exist is family bigotry making that a disproportionately huge chunk of the homeless youth population), but given that the FSA is a fascist state, and after a catastrophe like the Aberrant War I'm sure they're doing what fascists do and aggressively promoting repopulation, which leads to bigotry against the non-cisheteronormative, I suppose that unfortunately makes sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}